---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<Base title="Terms of use | Golf Outing Finder" description="The terms for using Golf Outing Finder." path="/terms" noindex crumbs={[{ name: "Terms", path: "/terms" }]}>
  <h1>Terms of use</h1>
  <p>Golf Outing Finder is a free directory of golf outings. By using it you agree to these terms.</p>
  <h2>Listings are information, not offers</h2>
  <p>
    We gather outing details from public web pages. Dates, prices and availability can change or be wrong. Always confirm with
    the organizer before you pay or travel. We don't sell entries, take payments or run any outing.
  </p>
  <h2>No endorsement</h2>
  <p>A listing doesn't mean we endorse the organizer, the course or the cause. "Charity" means the organizer matches IRS 501(c)(3) records, nothing more.</p>
  <h2>Using our content</h2>
  <p>You can link to any page. Please don't copy the site's listings in bulk.</p>
  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>The site is provided as is, without warranties. We aren't liable for losses from relying on a listing.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. The current version is always on this page.</p>
</Base>
